==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very simple stage, use the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to easily beat the stage.

